Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.30,0:00:06.05,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1218)\fad(200,250)\fnPoppins\b1\fs96\c&HFFFFFF&\bord0\shad0}o que ele pode fazer no seu rim?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Seu pai deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.10,0:00:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sua mãe deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}seu avô deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o seu vizinho deve ter.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}É uma epidemia mundial.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Nesse mês de novembro,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente tem uma data
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}muito importante,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que é o Dia Mundial
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.40,0:00:10.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do Diabetes.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Mas o diabetes
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}vai muito além
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}desse açúcar no sangue.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.48,0:00:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O que esse diabetes
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.48,0:00:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}pode fazer no seu rim?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Vocês já viram falar
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.90,0:00:24.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do fundo do olho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para o diabético?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.54,0:00:26.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O fundo do olho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é um exame
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}extremamente importante
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.82,0:00:29.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}em pacientes diabéticos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.68,0:00:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Você sabia disso?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Os vasos que têm
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dentro do olho,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}aqueles microvasos,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.82,0:00:38.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}eles são parecidos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}com os microvasos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.26,0:00:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que têm dentro do rim.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.38,0:00:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando a gente consegue
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ver lesão nesses microvasos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.94,0:00:45.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}no olho,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.74,0:00:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente já sabe
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que tem lesão no rim.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}As primeiras lesões de rim
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.24,0:00:51.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}acontecem com a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.78,0:00:52.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}perda de proteína.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.88,0:00:53.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}É aquela história
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.70,0:00:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do filtro de café
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.04,0:00:55.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que perde o pó.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando você perde esse pó,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você mostra que o teu rim,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o teu filtro,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.06,0:01:02.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}não está íntegro,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ele tem furos a mais
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que estão passando
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.56,0:01:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o que não deveria passar.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.04,0:01:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Às vezes,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.72,0:01:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a função continua normal,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}mas você já tem o início
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dessa doença renal.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Lembrando que a doença renal
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}só começa a ter sintomas
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.38,0:01:22.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}A maioria das vezes
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.26,0:01:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você não percebe,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você só vai perceber
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.36,0:01:25.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}no exame de sangue.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.58,0:01:26.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hoje em dia,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.48,0:01:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}nós temos inúmeras
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.32,0:01:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}medicações novas,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}então nós temos
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.44,0:01:30.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}muitas coisas
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.38,0:01:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para fazer por você.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Então, a minha dica aqui
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é de que você peça
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.96,0:01:35.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para o teu médico
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.74,0:01:37.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}fazer um exame de urina
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.58,0:01:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e um exame de creatinina
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.96,0:01:39.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para você.
